{"id":"1f8a0ce2c94a01a2","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/591_信念逻辑_Doxastic_Logic_KD_45.md","title":"591 信念逻辑 Doxastic Logic KD 45","display":"591_信念逻辑_Doxastic_Logic_KD_45","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号与显示约定\">1. 原始符号与显示约定</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\">\\(\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prop}_{591}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Prop}_{591}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>，且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:k\\to X\\ (Y=\\{e(i):i&lt;k\\})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:k\\to X\\ (Y=\\{e(i):i&lt;k\\})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>原始构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{bel}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{bel}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,\\bot,\\neg A,A\\to B,BA\">\\(p,\\bot,\\neg A,A\\to B,BA\\)</span>。派生记号为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat B A:=\\neg B\\neg A\">\\(\\widehat B A:=\\neg B\\neg A\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{591}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{591}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{591}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{591}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{591}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{591}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{591}\">\\(\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{591}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{591}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{591}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{591}\">\\(\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{591}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{591}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{591}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{591}\">\\(A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{591}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{591}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{591}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"BA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{591}\">\\(BA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{591}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变元与替换\">3. 自由变元与替换</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{591}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{591}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{591}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{591}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{591}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{591}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{591}(p)=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{591}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{591}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{591}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{591}(p)=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{591}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{591}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{591}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{591}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{PV}_{591}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{591}(B),\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{591}(BA)=\\operatorname{PV}_{591}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{591}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{PV}_{591}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{591}(B),\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{591}(BA)=\\operatorname{PV}_{591}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>无绑定。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{591}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{591}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{591})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{591}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{591}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{591})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{591}(A)=\\varnothing\">\\(\\operatorname{BV}_{591}(A)=\\varnothing\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\alpha,591}\">\\(\\equiv_{\\alpha,591}\\)</span> 为构造树相等。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{591}\n=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{591}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{591}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{591}:\\sigma(p)\\ne p\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{591})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Subst}_{591}\n=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{591}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{591}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{591}:\\sigma(p)\\ne p\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{591})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{591}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{591}\\times\\mathsf{Subst}_{591}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{591}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{591}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{591}\\times\\mathsf{Subst}_{591}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{591}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{591}\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{591}\\)</span>，替换满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{591}(p,\\sigma)=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{591}(\\bot,\\sigma)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{591}(\\neg A,\\sigma)=\\neg\\operatorname{Sub}_{591}(A,\\sigma),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{591}(p,\\sigma)=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{591}(\\bot,\\sigma)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{591}(\\neg A,\\sigma)=\\neg\\operatorname{Sub}_{591}(A,\\sigma),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{591}(A\\to B,\\sigma)=\\operatorname{Sub}_{591}(A,\\sigma)\\to\\operatorname{Sub}_{591}(B,\\sigma),\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{591}(BA,\\sigma)=B\\operatorname{Sub}_{591}(A,\\sigma).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{591}(A\\to B,\\sigma)=\\operatorname{Sub}_{591}(A,\\sigma)\\to\\operatorname{Sub}_{591}(B,\\sigma),\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{591}(BA,\\sigma)=B\\operatorname{Sub}_{591}(A,\\sigma).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-公理集合\">4. 公理集合</h1>\n<p>命题公理集合定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{591}\n=\n\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{591}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{591}\n=\n\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{591}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{591}\n=\n\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{591}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{591}\n=\n\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{591}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{591}\n=\n\\{(\\neg B\\to\\neg A)\\to(A\\to B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{591}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{591}\n=\n\\{(\\neg B\\to\\neg A)\\to(A\\to B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{591}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{591}=\\{\\neg\\bot\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{591}=\\{\\neg\\bot\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>信念公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{591}=\\{B(A\\to C)\\to(BA\\to BC):A,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{591}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{591}=\\{B(A\\to C)\\to(BA\\to BC):A,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{591}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{D}^{591}=\\{BA\\to\\neg B\\neg A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{591}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{D}^{591}=\\{BA\\to\\neg B\\neg A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{591}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{591}=\\{BA\\to BBA:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{591}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{5}^{591}=\\{\\neg BA\\to B\\neg BA:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{591}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{591}=\\{BA\\to BBA:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{591}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{5}^{591}=\\{\\neg BA\\to B\\neg BA:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{591}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{591}=\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{591}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{591}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{591}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{591}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{591}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{D}^{591}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{591}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{5}^{591}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{591}=\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{591}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{591}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{591}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{591}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{591}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{D}^{591}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{591}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{5}^{591}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-推理规则\">5. 推理规则</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{591}=\\{((A,A\\to C),C):A,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{591}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecB}^{591}=\\{((A),BA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{591}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{591}=\\{((A,A\\to C),C):A,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{591}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecB}^{591}=\\{((A),BA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{591}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to C}{C}\\ (MP),\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{BA}\\ (Nec_B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to C}{C}\\ (MP),\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{BA}\\ (Nec_B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{591}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{591}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecB}^{591}\n\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{591}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{591}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{591}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{591}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecB}^{591}\n\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{591}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{591}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-证明对象\">6. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{591}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{591}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{591}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{591}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 是所有非空有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\">\\(((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{591}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{591}\\)</span>，并且每行满足下列条件之一：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{591}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{591}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{591}\">\\(((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{591}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecB}^{591}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecB}^{591}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{last}_{591}(((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m})=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{last}_{591}(((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m})=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-可证性\">7. 可证性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{591}A\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{591}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \n\\operatorname{last}_{591}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{591}A\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{591}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \n\\operatorname{last}_{591}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{591}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{591}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{591}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{591}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{591}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{591}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-一致信念证书\">8. 一致信念证书</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"591\">\\(591\\)</span>-一致信念证书集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cert}_{D}^{591}\n=\\{(A,BA\\to\\neg B\\neg A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{591}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Cert}_{D}^{591}\n=\\{(A,BA\\to\\neg B\\neg A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{591}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>每个证书的第二分量恰属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{D}^{591}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{D}^{591}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"9.-目标区分\">9. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>本条目以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 表示信念，并使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D,4,5\">\\(D,4,5\\)</span> 三个信念特有公理；它不包含知识公理 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"BA\\to A\">\\(BA\\to A\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"10.-整个句法形式系统\">10. 整个句法形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{KD45}_{591}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{591},\\mathsf{Frm}_{591},\\operatorname{PV}_{591},\\operatorname{BV}_{591},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,591},\\mathsf{Subst}_{591},\\operatorname{Sub}_{591},\\mathsf{Ax}_{591},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{591},\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecB}^{591},\\mathsf{Rule}_{591},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{591},\\operatorname{last}_{591},\\vdash_{591},\\mathsf{Thm}_{591},\\mathsf{Cert}_{D}^{591}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{KD45}_{591}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{591},\\mathsf{Frm}_{591},\\operatorname{PV}_{591},\\operatorname{BV}_{591},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,591},\\mathsf{Subst}_{591},\\operatorname{Sub}_{591},\\mathsf{Ax}_{591},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{591},\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecB}^{591},\\mathsf{Rule}_{591},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{591},\\operatorname{last}_{591},\\vdash_{591},\\mathsf{Thm}_{591},\\mathsf{Cert}_{D}^{591}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只含信念逻辑句法、公理、规则、证明对象和可证性；不含序关系语义或信念修正语义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-原始符号与显示约定","text":"1. 原始符号与显示约定","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式","text":"2. 公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变元与替换","text":"3. 自由变元与替换","level":1},{"id":"4.-公理集合","text":"4. 公理集合","level":1},{"id":"5.-推理规则","text":"5. 推理规则","level":1},{"id":"6.-证明对象","text":"6. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"7.-可证性","text":"7. 可证性","level":1},{"id":"8.-一致信念证书","text":"8. 一致信念证书","level":1},{"id":"9.-目标区分","text":"9. 目标区分","level":1},{"id":"10.-整个句法形式系统","text":"10. 整个句法形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Prop}_{591}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:k\\to X\\ (Y=\\{e(i):i<k\\})\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{bel}.","display":true},{"tex":"p,\\bot,\\neg A,A\\to B,BA","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat B A:=\\neg B\\neg A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Frm}_{591}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{591}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{591}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{591}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{591}","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{591}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{591}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{591}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{591}","display":false},{"tex":"BA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{591}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PV}_{591}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{591}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{591}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PV}_{591}(p)=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{591}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{591}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{591}(A),